      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at `out/Default/gen/src/dawn/node/src/dawn/node/interop/WebGPU.h`, I see that `std::optional` is added for `textureBindingViewDimension` regardless of the `?` in the IDL file. That\u0027s why I\u0027ve removed it.\n\n```cpp\n// dictionary GPUTextureDescriptor\nclass GPUTextureDescriptor : public GPUObjectDescriptorBase {\npublic:\n...  \n  std::optional\u003cGPUTextureViewDimension\u003e textureBindingViewDimension;\n};\n```\n\nAlso, the proposal at https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/blob/main/proposals/compatibility-mode.md#1-texture-view-dimension-may-be-specified says:\n\n```webidl\npartial dictionary GPUTextureDescriptor {\n    GPUTextureViewDimension textureBindingViewDimension;\n}\n```",
